 floating-point numbers with arbitrary precision.

Package: libgmp-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libgmp (= ${binary:Version})
Description: multiple-precision arithmetic library: development files
 The C header, shared library link and pkg-config file for building
 programs against GMP.
